<title>USA: Camco Financial ups payout, sets stock div.</title>
<headline>Camco Financial ups payout, sets stock div.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Ohio 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.13		    $0.125</p>
<p> Pay		   July 21</p>
<p> Record		July 10</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Camco Financial Corp.</p>
<p>The company said shareholders also approved a 5 percent stock dividend to accompany the cash dividend. The stock dividend is payable July 21 to shareholders of record July 11.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
